diagrams.source:
flowchart TD
  F[a finding] --> C{fix is chmod 700 on the record folder?}
  C -- yes --> A[apply it, then re-run doctor]
  C -- no --> Q[show the exact command and ask first]
  Q --> Y{you say yes?}
  Y -- yes --> A
  Y -- no --> S[leave it, say so plainly]
  A --> D{doctor exits 0?}
  D -- no --> F
  D -- yes --> DONE[done, with the clean run shown]
